// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | CURRENT_DECISIONS
// task: ADR-045 User-Based Dashboard Sharing | date: 2026-03-10

#what_changed
=apps/api/src/models/dashboard.model.ts: removed shareToken/shareEnabled/generateShareToken; added sharedWithUsers:ObjectId[] with {sharedWithUsers:1} index
=apps/api/src/services/dashboard.service.ts: removed shareDashboard/revokeDashboardShare/getSharedDashboard/getSharedDeviceDerivedState; added shareWithUsers(orgId,dashboardId,userIds) with org-membership validation; added getDashboardsForViewer(orgId,userId); getDashboard now accepts {role,userId} options and gates Viewer access on sharedWithUsers; imports User model + ForbiddenError
=apps/api/src/controllers/dashboard.controller.ts: removed shareDashboard/revokeDashboardShare/getSharedDashboard/getSharedDeviceDerivedState handlers; added shareWithUsers handler (body:{userIds[]}); added getViewerDashboards handler; getDashboard passes {role,userId} from getRequestContext
=apps/api/src/routes/dashboard.routes.ts: removed 4 old share routes; added POST /dashboards/:id/share [requirePermission('dashboard:share')]; added GET /dashboards/my [requireAuth]; imports requirePermission from rbac.middleware
=apps/api/src/middleware/rbac.middleware.ts: added dashboard:read/write/share/delete to PERMISSIONS map (28 total)
=packages/types/src/index.ts: Dashboard interface updated (shareToken/shareEnabled removed, sharedWithUsers:string[] added)
=apps/web/lib/store/slices/dashboardSlice.ts: removed kosmosShareToken/kosmosShareEnabled/setKosmosShareInfo; added kosmosSharedWithUsers:string[], viewerDashboards:Dashboard[], fetchViewerDashboards thunk, setKosmosSharedWithUsers action
=apps/web/lib/hooks/useViewerDashboards.ts: NEW — React Query GET /dashboards/my
=apps/web/components/kosmos/ShareUsersModal.tsx: NEW — Viewer filter + multi-select + POST /share
=apps/web/components/kosmos/KosmosShell.tsx: readOnly prop added; share button → opens ShareUsersModal; edit controls hidden when readOnly
=apps/web/components/navigation/LayoutShell.tsx: NEW — client component hides Sidebar/TopBar for /viewer/* paths
=apps/web/app/layout.tsx: replaced inline TopBar+Sidebar with LayoutShell wrapper
=apps/web/app/viewer/layout.tsx: NEW — fullscreen kiosk layout
=apps/web/app/viewer/page.tsx: NEW — viewer kiosk (tab strip, KosmosShell readOnly)
=apps/web/app/login/page.tsx: Viewer role → redirect to /viewer after login
=DELETED: apps/web/app/view/[shareToken]/page.tsx, apps/web/lib/hooks/useSharedDeviceState.ts

#tech_implications
~All existing /view/:shareToken URLs return 404 (page deleted)
~Viewer users cannot browse /dashboards, /devices, /workflows — LayoutShell hides nav for /viewer route
~GET /dashboards/my returns empty array if no dashboards shared (viewer sees empty state)
~shareWithUsers replaces full list — calling with [] removes all access
~getDashboard returns ForbiddenError(403) if Viewer attempts to access unshared dashboard
~Old MongoDB documents retain shareToken/shareEnabled fields (schema has no strict: true) — harmless orphan fields; run db.dashboards.updateMany({},{$unset:{shareToken:'',shareEnabled:''}}) to clean up if needed

#constraints
~Viewer role must exist in same org as dashboard (validated in shareWithUsers service)
~GET /dashboards/my uses orgId+userId from JWT — Viewer must be fully authenticated
~KosmosShell readOnly=true removes all edit/share/palette controls — no escape hatch
~LayoutShell uses pathname.startsWith('/viewer') — any sub-routes of /viewer also get kiosk layout
